{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dive into depths of laboratories and stickmen!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Biotec is a shady company, suspected of commiting a serious crime behind the curtains. It went through several investigations, and yet nothing has been found. Explore the facility's interiors, seeking the truth yourself, and try to stop Biotec's tyranny once and for all.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gather and Craft</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game combines traditional metroidvania exploration with crafting mechanics, allowing you to gather resources and create items to aid on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world full of items required to craft new equipment, weapons and additional tools, all of which increase your chances of succeeding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419140/extras/b463e06b2ebdfb37924aca4a7b7c13a8.avif?t=1772909022\" width=800 height=292 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover various biomes and enviroments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Biotec's facility is full of laboratories, atmospheric server halls, large warehouses, lively greenhouses, smelly sewer systems, vast caves, and more. Explore each and every location in the game, discovering its secrets and lore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419140/extras/e86d7f03fc2526a5b9387209acdce913.avif?t=1772909022\" width=800 height=292 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight various foes and bosses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From neutral scientists, to killing machines, Biotec is full of dangerous foes that all lay as an obstacle on your journey. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419140/extras/1336648fbc28fb1b17d52dd2cc191aea.avif?t=1772909022\" width=800 height=292 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by old-school Flash games style and characters combine into a fun and nostalgic experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3419140?t=1772909022","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419140/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772909022","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419140/4d7b362ab12ec526bbf437012318b24117fa6a58/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772909022","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419140/4d7b362ab12ec526bbf437012318b24117fa6a58/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772909022","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3749820,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dive into depths of laboratories and stickmen!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Biotec is a shady company, suspected of commiting a serious crime behind the curtains. It went through several investigations, and yet nothing has been found. Explore the facility's interiors, seeking the truth yourself, and try to stop Biotec's tyranny once and for all.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gather and Craft</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game combines traditional metroidvania exploration with crafting mechanics, allowing you to gather resources and create items to aid on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world full of items required to craft new equipment, weapons and additional tools, all of which increase your chances of succeeding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419140/extras/b463e06b2ebdfb37924aca4a7b7c13a8.avif?t=1772909022\" width=800 height=292 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover various biomes and enviroments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Biotec's facility is full of laboratories, atmospheric server halls, large warehouses, lively greenhouses, smelly sewer systems, vast caves, and more. Explore each and every location in the game, discovering its secrets and lore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419140/extras/e86d7f03fc2526a5b9387209acdce913.avif?t=1772909022\" width=800 height=292 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight various foes and bosses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From neutral scientists, to killing machines, Biotec is full of dangerous foes that all lay as an obstacle on your journey. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419140/extras/1336648fbc28fb1b17d52dd2cc191aea.avif?t=1772909022\" width=800 height=292 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by old-school Flash games style and characters combine into a fun and nostalgic experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Reglan"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419140/header.jpg?t=1772909022","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_